{"code":"033050","name":"제이엠아이","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"가정용품","sector_desc":"생활용품·위생용품. 경기 방어적인 필수소비재입니다.","desc":"동사는 1993년 설립, 1997년 코스닥시장 상장, 마이크로소프트와 AR 계약 통해 MS OS 미디어화 사업으로 성장해왔음. 미국, 멕시코, 베트남에 종속법인을 운영하며, 2020년부터 미디어 복제업에서 기타 화학으로 사업 전환에 성공하였음. 국내 본사는 생활용품 OEM·ODM 사업을 주력으로 하고 있고, 미국법인은 라벨·인쇄 및 자동차 부품을, 베트남법인은 전자부품 제조를 진행하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-26","n_days":298,"close":779.0,"open":779.0,"high":779.0,"low":779.0,"volume":0,"amount":0.0,"ret_1d":0.0,"gap":0.0,"range_pct":0.0,"ret_5":0.0,"ret_20":-3.4696,"ret_60":-7.8107,"ret_120":-25.2399,"ret_250":-3.1095,"ma20":786.85,"ma60":830.05,"ma120":844.675,"ma200":859.765,"close_vs_ma200":-9.3938,"close_vs_ma60":-6.1502,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-49.8961,"r2_60":0.7104,"slope_120":-30.018,"r2_120":0.2728,"slope_250":0.8359,"r2_250":0.0008,"high52":1122.0,"low52":659.0,"pos_52w":25.9179,"dd_52w":-30.5704,"mdd_1y":-37.8159,"atr14_pct":2.5949,"vol_ann_60":34.4673,"vol_avg20":13107.2,"vol_ratio20":0.0,"vr5":0.0,"vr20":0.2082,"amount_avg5":0.0,"amount_avg20":10245313.75,"amount_avg60":48509470.7167,"obv_chg20":-26.1887,"turnover_20":0.8233,"pv_eff_20":-4.2141,"rsi14":43.5665,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":-23806.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.0748,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.0748,"frgn_net_60":90043.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.2828,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.2828,"frgn_net_120":124774.0,"inst_net_120":0.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.3919,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0,"smart_net_120_pct":0.3919,"foreign_ratio":0.92,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.29,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":18.0,"op_margin_q":5.8824,"op_qoq":80.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":350.0,"rev_yoy":42.9907,"op_trend_4q":6.5455,"fin_period":"202606","roe":11.36,"debt_ratio":78.15,"per":3.8,"pbr":0.4,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":0.92,"target_price":null,"recomm":null,"nxt_close":null,"nxt_change_pct":null,"cn